  "packageHash": "pLDKci1P1T7pLWXRNQKXWb9T3TNhdXFZUNv0TMawvy7D6z/9viP/ebLQKnAptoiVtrNJ9raNrASuObFwH2iDRg==",
  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 38099,
  "published": "2026-06-19T12:50:42.523Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Rebuilt on the FluxFlow.Nodes kit: source.generated and source.sequence are FlowSource<T> sources (started via StartAsync, items minted as FlowMessage envelopes carrying a fresh correlation id) that time off the injected TimeProvider. The engine factories, module, registration extensions, ports, type constants, design-metadata provider, the definition-options reader, and the JSON item/string-to-Type resolution layer (SourcesComponentOptions) are removed; GeneratedSourceNode takes its options plus the already-materialized items, SequenceSourceNode takes its options, and both take a TimeProvider directly and depend only on FluxFlow.Nodes (runs without the engine).",
